dates python_tuple v1
description "A date with the alias tuple. The function at the top of the Python module hides the built-in tuple the module annotates with, so mypy --strict does not pass, though what the code answers is the same (W001). Every other target takes it as it is"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31

date tuple = received
  + 30 days
